  <!-- Disguise start -->
  <!--原中文: '欺骗', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Deception',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Deception-->
  <TM_Disguise.label>欺骗</TM_Disguise.label>
  <!--原中文: '无面者通过操纵光影使任何看到他们的人潜意识的忽略他们。本质上就是让无脸者隐形。\n  \n无法欺骗已经把无面者视为威胁的单位。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The faceless manipulates light and motion to make their form appear meaningless to any observer; on a subconscious level, any observer will cognitively dismiss the faceless as an unimportant, harmless object, essentially making the faceless invisible.
	
Disguise will not fool any pawn that already sees the faceless as a threat.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The faceless manipulates light and motion to make their form appear meaningless to any observer; on a subconscious level, any observer will cognitively dismiss the faceless as an unimportant, harmless object, essentially making the faceless invisible.
	
Disguise will not fool any pawn that already sees the faceless as a threat.-->
  <TM_Disguise.description>无面者通过操纵光影使任何看到他们的人潜意识的忽略他们。本质上就是让无脸者隐形。\n  \n无法欺骗已经把无面者视为威胁的单位。</TM_Disguise.description>
  <!-- Mimic start -->
  <!--原中文: '模仿', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Mimic',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Mimic-->
  <TM_Mimic.label>模仿</TM_Mimic.label>
  <!--原中文: '无面者可以从法师或战士身上复制一个随机能力。一次只能存储一个能力，重复使用会替代之前的技能。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The faceless copies a random ability from a mage or fighter. Only one ability may be stored at a time. The ability is retained after use; reusing Mimic will replace the stored ability.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The faceless copies a random ability from a mage or fighter. Only one ability may be stored at a time. The ability is retained after use; reusing Mimic will replace the stored ability.-->
  <TM_Mimic.description>无面者可以从法师或战士身上复制一个随机能力。一次只能存储一个能力，重复使用会替代之前的技能。</TM_Mimic.description>
  <!-- Reversal Start -->
  <!--原中文: '倒转', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Reversal',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Reversal-->
  <TM_Reversal.label>倒转</TM_Reversal.label>
  <!--原中文: '在短时间内逆转所有近战和远程攻击。无脸者不会受到这些攻击的伤害。不能逆转技能和爆炸攻击。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Reverses the kinetic energy of all melee and projectile attacks for a brief period. The faceless will take no damage from these attacks. Direct application and explosive attacks cannot be reversed.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Reverses the kinetic energy of all melee and projectile attacks for a brief period. The faceless will take no damage from these attacks. Direct application and explosive attacks cannot be reversed.-->
  <TM_Reversal.description>在短时间内逆转所有近战和远程攻击。无脸者不会受到这些攻击的伤害。不能逆转技能和爆炸攻击。</TM_Reversal.description>
