  <!-- Possess -->
  <!--原中文: '占据', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Possess',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Possess-->
  <TM_Possess.label>占据</TM_Possess.label>
  <!--原中文: '就像木偶大师精神和身体的无表情运用会对目标生物产生极端的自我怀疑——这让他们能够通过心理暗示和胁迫来控制目标。		\n  \n附近的敌人除非看到可疑活动，否则不太可能立即发现藏匿物。如果被发现，中立和友好的派系会将被附身的单位的侵略行为视为敌对行为。\n\n只有具有类似人类的能够自我怀疑的头脑的生物才能被拥有。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Like a puppet master, the faceless applies of the mind and body to cause extreme self-doubt on a target pawn - allowing them to control their target through mental suggestion and coercion. 
		
Nearby enemies are unlikely to immediately detect the possession unless they see suspicious activity. If detected, neutral and friendly factions will consider aggressive actions from a possessed pawn as an act of hostility.

Only creatures with a human-like mind capable of self-doubt can be possessed.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Like a puppet master, the faceless applies of the mind and body to cause extreme self-doubt on a target pawn - allowing them to control their target through mental suggestion and coercion. 
		
Nearby enemies are unlikely to immediately detect the possession unless they see suspicious activity. If detected, neutral and friendly factions will consider aggressive actions from a possessed pawn as an act of hostility.

Only creatures with a human-like mind capable of self-doubt can be possessed.-->
  <TM_Possess.description>就像木偶大师精神和身体的无表情运用会对目标生物产生极端的自我怀疑——这让他们能够通过心理暗示和胁迫来控制目标。		\n  \n附近的敌人除非看到可疑活动，否则不太可能立即发现藏匿物。如果被发现，中立和友好的派系会将被附身的单位的侵略行为视为敌对行为。\n\n只有具有类似人类的能够自我怀疑的头脑的生物才能被拥有。</TM_Possess.description>
